  "description": "In Eden City, no one slips through the shadows quite like Gemma Steele, the infamous jewel thief. So when the determined Inspector Raven Hunt finally catches her, she expects a jail cell, not a proposal. But Raven needs her skills to retrieve a priceless royal gem, and a fake marriage is the perfect cover. Now, the city's most wanted thief and its most straightlaced officer must team up to play newlyweds. Can Gemma and Raven pull off their act without getting caught in each other's feelings?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
